          "relation": "definition",
          "snippet": {
            "line": 392,
            "text": "structure CleanOutgoingCone {d : TailData} {K : ℝ} (w : ResetWitness d K) (XR left : ℝ) : Prop where\n  relaxed : ∀ p ∈ cleanWindow d left,\n    RelaxedAt w (CorrectedPulseAmplitude.amplitude d w.coefficients) XR p\n  true_from_hold : ∀ p ∈ trueWindow d,\n    TrueAt w (CorrectedPulseAmplitude.amplitude d w.coefficients) XR p"
          }
        }
      }
